OL,3,GNEWSAHospital stops gas and air use    
OL,4,Aover safety fears                      
OL,6,FThe move follows payouts to 121 members
OL,7,Fof staff totalling #735,000 from the   
OL,8,Ftrust in October, due to over-exposure 
OL,9,Fto the gas.                            
